{"step_index":234,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T20:59:07Z","thinking":"**Designing API Status Banner Component**\n\nThe requirement calls for a reusable component to communicate API status effectively. Considering the need for loading, live connection, and error states suggests a conditional rendering approach based on API status data. This component will require a status prop, and potentially a data prop to display connection details and error messages.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import React from 'react'\nimport { AlertTriangle, CheckCircle2, Loader2, RefreshCw } from 'lucide-react'\nimport { Button } from '../ui/button'\n\ninterface ApiStatusBannerProps {\n  loading?: boolean\n  error?: string | null\n  onRetry?: () => void\n  label?: string\n}\n\nexport const ApiStatusBanner: React.FC<ApiStatusBannerProps> = ({\n  loading,\n  error,\n  onRetry,\n  label = 'BACKEND API',\n}) => {\n  if (loading) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-1.5 rounded bg-cyan-950/40 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n          <Loader2 className=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-spin text-cyan-400\" />\n          <span>{label} // Fetching live data from http://localhost:8000...</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n\n  if (error) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 rounded bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-500/50 text-amber-300 text-xs font-mono\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n          <AlertTriangle className=\"h-4 w-4 text-amber-400 shrink-0\" />\n          <div>\n            <span className=\"font-bold text-amber-200\">BACKEND DISCONNECTED: </span>\n            <span className=\"text-amber-300/90\">{error}</span>\n            <span className=\"text-slate-400 ml-1\">(Displaying synthetic baseline fallback)</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        {onRetry && (\n          <Button\n            variant=\"outline\"\n            size=\"sm\"\n            onClick={onRetry}\n            className=\"h-6 px-2 text-[10px] border-amber-500/40 text-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-950/60 flex items-center space-x-1\"\n          >\n            <RefreshCw className=\"h-3 w-3\" />\n            <span>Retry</span>\n          </Button>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    )\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-1 rounded bg-slate-900/60 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-[11px] font-mono\">\n      <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n        <CheckCircle2 className=\"h-3 w-3 text-emerald-400\" />\n        <span>LIVE BACKEND SYNCED // http://localhost:8000 (Synthetic Investigation Dataset)</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n","Description":"Create ApiStatusBanner component","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Nityam Jaiswal\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\nexus\\src\\components\\common\\ApiStatusBanner.tsx","toolAction":"Writing ApiStatusBanner.tsx","toolSummary":"Create ApiStatusBanner.tsx"}}]}
